{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_title", "source_sha256": "a0a798150cf6f253c2c5b1e72cf87e5ac9a220290875692dda0801d92a286f36", "ja": "いつだってWelcome!!", "zh": "随时都Welcome!!", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e06a3ec3ec6658b734b0267d80dd8880a3841a4e001379e1e79d3c1b6362b2d7", "ja": "年の瀬、劇場の大掃除を手伝うアイドル達。\n最近はコラボや地方の仕事が増えたと話して\nいる所に、社長から案件が飛び込む。依頼主\nである美璃恩市を見学したアイドル達は、\nライブでお客さんを呼び込む事を決める。", "zh": "岁末，偶像们正在剧场帮忙大扫除。\n正当大家聊着最近联名合作与外地的工作增多时，\n社长送来了一份工作委托。在参观完委托方\n美璃恩市后，偶像们决定通过演出吸引客流。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1000_p", "source_sha256": "704e4087e215bee68cf87ba04bfb2ceb20de362f345ba9373fa1e2b8f179fce8", "ja": "（美璃恩市でのライブは大成功！\n途切れることのない拍手と歓声が響いている……）", "zh": "（在美璃恩市举办的演出大获成功！不绝于耳的掌声与欢呼声回荡着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bf4575cf8e54b4cf553f3f4f8f6828e8f7cb4637e0fd9a9f90b64a619ce0367e", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　ライブはもちろん、\nビラ配りまで、色々頑張ってくれてありがとう！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！不仅是演出，\n连发传单等各项工作，都很感谢你们的努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "a222cfd1873e246101fcf21332cd159fd27ee71728eaff144e881ad987dfd0bf", "ja": "当然だろ？　あたし達の仕事は、\n美璃恩市に人を集めることなんだからさ！", "zh": "这不是当然的嘛？我们的工作，\n本来就是要给美璃恩市吸引人气啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "4152410f0bf3aef0fcf13a6aef4c0430359892bd15f606cacfab1d6232d9ed93", "ja": "それに、ウチらはアイドルだ。ステージを\n盛り上げないなんて、ありえないからな♪", "zh": "而且，我们可是偶像。要是不能让舞台热闹起来，那才不可能呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "190322fbc48a476ecea6a49bfdb51f2a09a56486109ad6007e38b162c9fbaeab", "ja": "私も、とっても気持ちよく歌えちゃいました♪\n歌声が、すーって空に吸い込まれるみたいで……。", "zh": "我也唱得特别畅快♪\n感觉歌声就这样被天空一点点吸走了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1005_p", "source_sha256": "363c756772a3461d20f1ab2cedf5ffcacb226107cb97a6f36d8bb6268ba1c624", "ja": "確かに、今日の麗花は特に調子が良かったみたいだな。\n来てくれたお客さん達も、満足してくれたと思う！", "zh": "确实，今天的丽花状态特别好。\n来的客人们应该也都很满意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "ce0cb6eb393b34edada52fdab602c75dc5c658eecb11c51bc6ef57783199ea8f", "ja": "わーいわーい！　{$P$}さんに\n褒められちゃった！", "zh": "好耶好耶！被{$P$}先生夸奖了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d9ce47770476673e7bf1fbcdf6bbb10e07f8961c703735047e9108f4db68906b", "ja": "セットリストもバラエティに富んでたからな。\nロックにEDMに、ラップ……。", "zh": "因为演出曲目安排也很丰富嘛。\n摇滚、EDM，还有说唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1008_p", "source_sha256": "66c5f935ca3e71d7723a1d14e5db57e877956c3af29b0389266210dad5772846", "ja": "その分、みんなは\nレッスンが大変だったと思うけど……。", "zh": "不过，大家的训练也很辛苦吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "6e95e62f0c29979c25334e004b959cfe38330eff9341511a5b1b14e2845939f0", "ja": "ええ。ですが、アイドルのライブに\n馴染みのない方々もいらっしゃいますから。", "zh": "是的。不过，毕竟也有些人不太熟悉偶像的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "613e33a235a1e3edd83e26ff86b12a74ad0c452f78c68553b80a3f85124c22ee", "ja": "自然と体が動いたり、コールがわかりやすかったり……\nそういう楽曲が多いほうが、盛り上がりますもの♪", "zh": "如果多一些能让人自然而然动起来、应援口号也容易喊的歌曲，就更能炒热气氛了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "77c4c8edfd9595f339f55cb06de52b6ea345b7ae0c3b73658dd5623fd8d9ccd6", "ja": "楽曲のバラエティだったら、\n私たち、自信がありますからね！", "zh": "说到歌曲的多样性，我们可是很有自信的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "1ad2b325a83383419935e9973e7223194f53c0d890a39c06dbd908b93f9fbe25", "ja": "満漢全席みたいなライブで、最高でした♪\nお客さんも、喜んでくれてるといいんですけど……。", "zh": "那场像满汉全席一样丰富多彩的演唱会，真是太棒了♪\n希望客人们也能喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1013_audience", "source_sha256": "29804ec313346fa7cd59236f151b72b1a1dcdf7b0baf30265fde39201ce6714a", "ja": "ワァアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "5903baa4dbc54a0cfa24eb17d8a250f4b439f0dbc92443ffb0e1b3e4c960c9ad", "ja": "わっ、まだこんなに歓声が……。\nもしかしてみんな、おかわりが足りない……？", "zh": "哇，欢呼声居然还这么热烈……\n难道说大家，还觉得不够饱……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "781e3221e2bfd044e82ab2dd9f9597c5007eacd5b987f204830df3cd2aea1fb5", "ja": "アンコールも終わったのに……けど、無理もないか。\n何しろ、茜ちゃん達のステージを見ちゃったんだしね！", "zh": "安可演出都结束了……不过，这也难怪。\n毕竟都看过小茜们的舞台了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "7f4443fc7943935f6774c1bd4ab19c4faaa36b381140f74f1a18e51da9b29db2", "ja": "慢心には、釘を刺したいところですが……\nあのステージの後です。目をつぶりましょう～。", "zh": "虽然很想提醒一下不要得意忘形……\n\n不过毕竟是在看过那场演出之后，就睁一只眼闭一只眼吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "4d902e0cc41c3205278931ca576a9d73ef7cbec4caf5a411d12a02a8c81ed7b9", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。みんなも、\nせっかくだから、もう一曲歌っちゃわない？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}。大家难得有这个机会，\n不如再唱一首吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8acc90e48ef5d28153e297d7cee1010732f726a4fd0adbbec62d260b0f5d6240", "ja": "賛成！　ねえねえ、いいでしょ？\n{$P$}さん～。", "zh": "赞成！呐呐，可以吧？{$P$}先生～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c5ef5cbebcc31f0f7295902d846c78215f1c33ec6f4902e9cd56c4fed063c008", "ja": "そうだな……。うん。音響、いけるみたいだ。\nもう一回、同じ曲で。", "zh": "是啊……嗯。音响好像没问题了。\n再来一次，还是同一首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "5ea38e3a2b3fcf07b20f9086caa66621f5a5d2ffd4bfd5224f383928ae5ab98e", "ja": "わーいわーい！\nありがとうございます{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇——太棒啦太棒啦！\n谢谢您，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "55147eb8d16a8e778b2e0789ec14e80b527b36a286ebafa497d46c16e7ef4bed", "ja": "それじゃみなさん、最後はもう一回、\nあの曲で……行きますよ～？", "zh": "那么各位，最后再来一次，\n就唱那首歌……要上咯～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
