{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_160_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "3fea92a44958d77457a9d7f292b5598e0f83328352f73d0055929b0592ac60da", "ja": "これが本当に、最後の曲です！\nみなさん、今日は美璃恩市に……！", "zh": "这真的就是最后一首歌了！  \n大家，今天在美璃恩市……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
